                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Riddles of the past is a very short game with multiple twists. This game is the definition of casual point and click, you just sit there and enjoy the comic style cutscenes and extra easy puzzles. The story is average, music is ok, voice over was not bad. The graphics and characters design is really good except for the poor little puppy who they used for the hint button, he is out of the place. \n\nhttp://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1168494193\n\nThe hidden objects scenes are different from the usual. When you interact with a spot in an area, five to six objects needed appears in a circle which you have to collect from the same area then you can proceed.  \n\nPros:\n+Fast travel map.\n+OK music (a little bit repetitive)\n+Good graphics.\n+Good journal.\n+So many locations to visit.\n+Steam achievements.\n\nCons:\n-Short game.\n-No bonus chapter.\n-Orange hint button puppy.\n-Not so good ending.\n\nIt isn't a completely bad game, give it a go if you find it with a good discount or in a bundle because you'll at least enjoy the visuals!\nhttp://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1168561713\n\n[quote]𝐹𝑜𝑟 𝑚𝑜𝑟𝑒 𝑟𝑒𝑣𝑖𝑒𝑤𝑠 𝑐𝘩𝑒𝑐𝑘 𝑚𝑦 𝑐𝑢𝑟𝑎𝑡𝑜𝑟 𝑝𝑎𝑔𝑒 [url=http://store.steampowered.com/curator/32399565/]𝐹𝑒𝑒𝑛𝑎'𝑠 𝐶𝘩𝑜𝑖𝑐𝑒[/url][/quote]",
